D SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD NEWLINE SLASHWORD SPACE STRING SPACE STRING SPACE STRING SPACE STRING SPACE STRING NEWLINE STRING SPACE STRING SPACE STRING SPACE STRING SPACE STRING SPACE STRING NEWLINE STRING SPACE STRING SPACE STRING SPACE STRING SPACE STRING SPACE STRING NEWLINE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD NEWLINE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE STRING SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE STRING NEWLINE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD NEWLINE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD NEWLINE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD NEWLINE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD NEWLINE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD NEWLINE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD NEWLINE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD NEWLINE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD NEWLINE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD NEWLINE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD NEWLINE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD NEWLINE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD NEWLINE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD NEWLINE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD NEWLINE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD NEWLINE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD NEWLINE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASHWORD SPACE SLASH